  "content_rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#5d5d58\"></span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"2560\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-2601\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Tumon-Beach-2-2-scaled.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Tumon-Beach-2-2-scaled.jpg 1920w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Tumon-Beach-2-2-225x300.jpg 225w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Tumon-Beach-2-2-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Tumon-Beach-2-2-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Tumon-Beach-2-2-1536x2048.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-752e5b9e184f7225da592fb5c7a3f517\" style=\"font-size:2rem\">あなたの旅をサポートする、Mokaruの充実サービス</h2>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Mokaruでは、<strong>お客様一人ひとりの旅のスタイルに合わせたサービス</strong>をご提供しています。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">👶 <strong>お子様連れのご家族へ</strong><br>ベビーカー・チャイルドシート完備で移動も安心！お子様が楽しめるスポットや休憩しやすいプランをご提案します。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">🛫 <strong>初めてのグアム旅行の方へ</strong><br>空港送迎から観光サポートまで、日本語ガイドがしっかりサポート。土地勘がなくても安心してグアムを満喫できます！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">💍 <strong>ハネムーンや特別な旅を楽しみたい方へ</strong><br>プライベートツアーで贅沢な時間を演出。ロマンチックなサンセットや特別なディナーの予約もお任せください。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">🚗 <strong>旅行会社が対応してくれない場所へ行きたい方へ</strong><br>ローカルなビーチ、穴場のレストラン、観光地以外のエリアへも専用車で快適に移動。行きたい場所を自由に選べます。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">🏡 <strong>不動産視察やビジネス目的の方へ</strong><br>物件視察や商談の送迎も可能。移動中の通訳やエリア情報のご案内もお手伝いします。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">✈️ <strong>そのほか、なんでもご相談ください！</strong><br>「こんなことできる？」「ここに行ける？」など、どんなリクエストでもお気軽にお問い合わせください。Mokaruがあなたのグアム滞在を<strong>快適＆スムーズにサポート</strong>します！</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-lg--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim has-background-gradient has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-heading\"><div class=\"vk_heading vk_heading-style-plain\"><h2 style=\"margin-bottom:0rem;text-align:center\" class=\"vk_heading_title vk_heading_title-style-plain has-text-color has-black-color\"><span>主な特長</span></h2></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns vk-cols--has-btn is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-white-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;paddi