\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer\"><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-pc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-tablet\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-mobile\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom is-style-default has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-f602ee31a6ac93ba365accf4389777bb\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem\">ハネムーンや特別な旅も対応</h3>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-white-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-noline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color\" style=\"width:calc(64px + 0px);height:calc(64px + 0px)\"><i style=\"font-size:64px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-plane-arrival\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer\"><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-pc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-tablet\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-mobile\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom is-style-default has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-676d94b3442d913d939a74bef6caf160\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem\">深夜・早朝の到着便も対応</h3>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-white-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-noline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color\" style=\"width:calc(64px + 0px);height:calc(64px + 0px)\"><i style=\"font-size:64px\" class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-person-circle-question\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer\"><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-pc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-tablet\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-mobile\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.8rem\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom is-style-default has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-f008d4570398ca914bfbb488ddab11ba\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem\">その他、何でも相談ください</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-heading\"><div class=\"vk_heading vk_heading-style-plain\"><h2 style=\"margin-bottom:0rem;text-align:center\" class=\"vk_heading_title vk_heading_title-style-plain has-text-color has-black-color\"><span>サポートオプション</span></h2></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong><span data-color=\"#ff6900\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%,rgba(255, 105, 0, 0.7) 0);\" class=\"vk_highlighter\">＼こんな方におすすめ／</span></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-vk-check-circle-mark vk_list_1\">\n<li><strong>空港送迎</strong>・移動をスムーズにしたい方</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>延長プラン（1時間ごと）</strong>もう少し観光を楽しみたい方</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>追加車両手配（グループ旅行向け）</strong>  6名以上の団体向けに追加車両を手配</li>\n</ul>\n</div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/sample-img03-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1463 size-full\" srcset=\"https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/sample-img03-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/sample-img03-300x200.jpg 300w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/sample-img03-768x512.jpg 768w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/sample-img03-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://mokaruguam.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/sample-img03.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-xxl--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-outline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-vk-color-primary-color\"><i class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-xs--margin-bottom\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-vk-heading-plain vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom\">最適なプランを提案します</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-xs--margin-bottom\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">お客様のご希望やご予定に合わせて、<strong>最適なプランをカスタマイズ</strong>いたします。</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-outline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-vk-color-primary-color\"><i class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-handshake\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-xs--margin-bottom\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-vk-heading-plain vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom\"><strong>交渉・商談もお任せください</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-xs--margin-bottom\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">ホテルへのクレーム、レストランでのリクエスト、ビジネス商談の通訳としても同行いたします。</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-icon vk_icon\"><div class=\"vk_icon_frame text-center is-style-outline\"><div class=\"vk_icon_border has-text-color has-vk-color-primary-color\"><i class=\"fa-solid vk_icon_font fa-baby-carriage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-xs--margin-bottom\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-vk-heading-plain vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom\">ベビーカー・シート貸出</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-bottom\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-xs--margin-bottom\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">アメリカの法律上チャイルドシートは必須。無料で貸し出し・設置いたします。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-border-box vk_borderBox vk_borderBox-background-transparent has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color is-style-vk_borderBox-style-solid-kado-tit-onborder\"><div class=\"vk_borderBox_title_container\"><i class=\"\"></i><h4 class=\"vk_borderBox_title\">オプション料金</h4></div><div class=\"vk_borderBox_body\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>空港送迎　⁻　＄４５（往復）　＄２５（片道）</li>\n\n\n\n<li>延長プラン　⁻　＄５０（１時間当たり）</li>\n\n\n\n<li>追加車両手配　⁻　＄１５０～　（車種により変動あり）</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-heading\"><div class=\"vk_heading vk_heading-style-plain\"><h2 style=\"margin-bottom:0rem;text-align:center\" class=\"vk_heading_title vk_heading_title-style-plain has-text-color has-black-color\"><span>料金プラン</span></h2></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-margin-md--margin-top\"></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Mokaruの料金プランからお選びください</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-align-center\"><a href=\"/price/\" class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background has-vk-color-primary-background-color btn-md\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\">料金プランを比較する</span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-angle-right vk_button_link_after\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer vk_spacer-type-margin-top\"><div class=\"vk_block-mar